{"2300100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seeker Quest: The Creature Collector", "steam_appid": 2300100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4078050], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seeker: Quest - The Monster Collecting Adventure </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Catch &amp; Hatch new playable characters, loot items, artifacts, and abilities in this <strong>top-down adventure &amp; monster collector</strong>. Explore cute and colorful, handcrafted worlds, battle wild Seekers, and collect them to build your ultimate team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/d5ae462ac828634c50fb3a18131a0775.poster.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/d5ae462ac828634c50fb3a18131a0775.webm?t=1777274154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Collect Seekers, Build Your Team</strong><br>Every Seeker you encounter can join your crew. Defeat them, collect their Seekeggs, and hatch them into playable characters (And get that juicy Steam Achievement). With each Seeker having their own set of abilities, you’ll mix, match, and experiment to build the perfect team for any challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Pace the Action</strong> <br>Pause the game with a single button to switch Seekers mid-battle, to cast buffs or activate Hero Abilities. Naturia Planet offers <strong>fun adventures</strong>, hidden secrets, and endless ways to customize your team for the ultimate reward: By catching all the Seekers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/89f5cbe956deb5b351ef6bb9d1c38b9a.poster.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/89f5cbe956deb5b351ef6bb9d1c38b9a.webm?t=1777274154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏠 Build and Upgrade Your Village</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, unlock new buildings, and heroes to give your Seekers all kinds of upgrades. As your village grows, so does your team. It’s not just about leveling up—it’s about unlocking powers to take on intense boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8b53d9bba56d9b448661a94eca704505.poster.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8b53d9bba56d9b448661a94eca704505.webm?t=1777274154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌿 Adventure &amp; Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroll through lush, handcrafted levels packed with surprises. From traps and treasures to artifacts and pooplets, <i>Seeker: Quest</i> rewards exploration. Even if your team gets wiped out, luck might help you hatch a new Seeker with perfect attributes—or you’ll find Orbs of Resurrection to bring your pumped-up team back into the fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌄 <strong>Get the Event Island Keys!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are unique event monsters available to catch and hatch. New event islands appear within the updates! Each season comes with an island featuring its own challenges and, ultimately, the battle against the new Seeker you need to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/e44c4f21313d13f10b2e05b62a3dbb15.poster.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/e44c4f21313d13f10b2e05b62a3dbb15.webm?t=1777274154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>📜 <strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrected by the god-like Seeker Leerking, the planet Naturia has become a paradise for Seekers. But when humans arrived, seeking the precious Sylvan Ore, a rebellion erupted, forcing the invaders back. Now, the Wild Seekers control the land, but something more sinister is at work beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jesterians, exiled rebels from the Abyss—a realm of darkness beyond comprehension—accidentally arrived on Naturia through a portal. Exiled from Sylvania, their once-beloved home, they endured the Abyss’s horrors and survived. Now stranded on this strange planet, they must fight for survival and find a way back to their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by <strong>Ive</strong>, a fearless young leader with a vision to restore balance, the Jesterians include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draven</strong>: A former King's Guard searching for redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naman’Ghal</strong>: A shaman deeply connected to the planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Azreal</strong>: A Sylvan Mage bent on revenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they must uncover the secrets of Naturia as the shadow of Leerking looms ever closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8579353329f0930219abcc159776eb55.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=249 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Join Early Access Today</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Seeker: Quest</i> with <strong>60-90 minutes</strong> of exciting gameplay in Early Access. More Seekers, levels, and adventures are coming, and your feedback will help shape the world of <i>Seeker: Quest</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s time to hatch a new adventure—are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Solo Game Developer: Jestercraft. The journey of <i>“Shipping 24 Games in 24 Months.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/468dbf7a2745c91256ce2512a9db5988.avif?t=1777274154\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seeker: Quest - The Monster Collecting Adventure </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Catch &amp; Hatch new playable characters, loot items, artifacts, and abilities in this <strong>top-down adventure &amp; monster collector</strong>. Explore cute and colorful, handcrafted worlds, battle wild Seekers, and collect them to build your ultimate team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras