cking powers to take on intense boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8b53d9bba56d9b448661a94eca704505.poster.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8b53d9bba56d9b448661a94eca704505.webm?t=1777274154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌿 Adventure &amp; Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stroll through lush, handcrafted levels packed with surprises. From traps and treasures to artifacts and pooplets, <i>Seeker: Quest</i> rewards exploration. Even if your team gets wiped out, luck might help you hatch a new Seeker with perfect attributes—or you’ll find Orbs of Resurrection to bring your pumped-up team back into the fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌄 <strong>Get the Event Island Keys!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are unique event monsters available to catch and hatch. New event islands appear within the updates! Each season comes with an island featuring its own challenges and, ultimately, the battle against the new Seeker you need to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/e44c4f21313d13f10b2e05b62a3dbb15.poster.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=239 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/e44c4f21313d13f10b2e05b62a3dbb15.webm?t=1777274154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>📜 <strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrected by the god-like Seeker Leerking, the planet Naturia has become a paradise for Seekers. But when humans arrived, seeking the precious Sylvan Ore, a rebellion erupted, forcing the invaders back. Now, the Wild Seekers control the land, but something more sinister is at work beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jesterians, exiled rebels from the Abyss—a realm of darkness beyond comprehension—accidentally arrived on Naturia through a portal. Exiled from Sylvania, their once-beloved home, they endured the Abyss’s horrors and survived. Now stranded on this strange planet, they must fight for survival and find a way back to their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Led by <strong>Ive</strong>, a fearless young leader with a vision to restore balance, the Jesterians include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draven</strong>: A former King's Guard searching for redemption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Naman’Ghal</strong>: A shaman deeply connected to the planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Azreal</strong>: A Sylvan Mage bent on revenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they must uncover the secrets of Naturia as the shadow of Leerking looms ever closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/8579353329f0930219abcc159776eb55.avif?t=1777274154\" width=616 height=249 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Join Early Access Today</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Seeker: Quest</i> with <strong>60-90 minutes</strong> of exciting gameplay in Early Access. More Seekers, levels, and adventures are coming, and your feedback will help shape the world of <i>Seeker: Quest</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s time to hatch a new adventure—are you ready?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Solo Game Developer: Jestercraft. The journey of <i>“Shipping 24 Games in 24 Months.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/extras/468dbf7a2745c91256ce2512a9db5988.avif?t=1777274154\" width=800 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build the ultimate team by catching &amp; hatching cute 'Seeker' creatures. Power up your collection by looting artifacts, hidden abilities and grow your village to obtain new buildings and heroes. Over 30 unique playable Seeker characters awaits! Can you 'Catch &amp; Hatch' them all?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/header.jpg?t=1777274154", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/579dd3c893a29bd673e368cb93ded93c5177bb95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777274154", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300100/579dd3c893a29bd673e368cb93ded93c5177bb95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777274154", "website": "https://www.jestercraft.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (32-bit) or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1866) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7600 GS (512 MB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_r